Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.12,0:00:12.16,Main - Top,DOLAN,0,0,0,,That was one awful nightmare you showed me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.16,0:00:14.15,Main,KALAVITH,0,0,0,,You deserved it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.54,0:00:19.50,Main,KALAVITH,0,0,0,,As a dragon, you used the \Nhero to give up your life
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.82,0:00:24.12,Main,KALAVITH,0,0,0,,and abandoned the people, the gods, \Nthe other dragons, and me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.49,0:00:27.24,Main,KALAVITH,0,0,0,,And now you're living a peaceful \Nlife like nothing happened?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.17,0:00:31.40,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.36,0:00:35.30,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,I had given up on life.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.20,0:00:38.45,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,But it's different now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.48,0:00:41.64,Main - Top,DOLAN,0,0,0,,After being reborn as a human,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.64,0:00:46.04,Main - Top,DOLAN,0,0,0,,my parents, fellow villagers,\NCelina, Chris...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.51,0:00:48.77,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,They all helped me realize...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.50,0:00:54.16,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,that I lacked the resolve to live \Nduring my dragon life.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.23,0:00:56.78,Main,KALAVITH,0,0,0,,Resolve?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.78,0:01:03.35,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,To swear that you'll face any and all \Ndifficulties without ever backing down.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.98,0:01:06.65,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,And now I have it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.65,0:01:08.83,Main,KALAVITH,0,0,0,,Hah, what the heck?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.83,0:01:12.14,Main,KALAVITH,0,0,0,,What exactly did you swear \Nto yourself, Dolly?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.14,0:01:13.73,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,Isn't it obvious?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.41,0:01:19.65,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,I swore to live my life, as a human \Nwith a dragon soul, to the fullest.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.44,0:01:24.61,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,Bring on all the despair and \Ndifficulties in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.20,0:01:28.51,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,I am not about to back down, \Nnot a single step.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.26,0:01:33.12,Main,KALAVITH,0,0,0,,You're so cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.52,0:01:36.53,Main,KALAVITH,0,0,0,,But this is my world, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.53,0:01:39.41,Main,KALAVITH,0,0,0,,You're not going back without a fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.12,0:01:50.20,Main,KALAVITH,0,0,0,,It's that crazy, evil dragon that gave you \Nand the hero so much trouble! Say he...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.20,0:01:51.20,Main,KALAVITH,0,0,0,,...llo?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.96,0:02:01.96,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,You may think this is a game,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.35,0:02:06.15,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,but I cannot stand the sight of that thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.15,0:02:07.72,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,Now die.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.16,0:02:10.40,Main,KALAVITH,0,0,0,,Huh? No way! Wait, timeout!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.40,0:02:12.87,Main,KALAVITH,0,0,0,,I'm sowwy!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.23,0:02:19.99,Ep_Title,EPTITLE,0,0,0,,{\fad(875,0)}Hello, Human Life
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.29,0:02:24.23,Main,KALAVITH,0,0,0,,This is all wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.62,0:02:27.25,Main,KALAVITH,0,0,0,,You were supposed to be \Nweaker after rebirth!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.25,0:02:29.36,Main,KALAVITH,0,0,0,,And I didn't hold back one bit!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.60,0:02:33.90,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,Excuse me for being in a \Nmurderous rage after that nightmare.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.69,0:02:38.29,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,But this strength will only \Nlast me through this life.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.70,0:02:44.26,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,Should I be reborn again, \Nmy soul may degrade.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.58,0:02:47.51,Main,KALAVITH,0,0,0,,The curse of the fallen gods, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.87,0:02:50.87,Main,KALAVITH,0,0,0,,They put a nasty reincarnation curse on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.15,0:02:57.91,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,And after several of those, \Nmy soul is sure to perish.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.91,0:03:05.42,Main,KALAVITH,0,0,0,,Oh... So you'll be gone eventually, \Neven if I do nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.81,0:03:09.98,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,What's this? I thought you'd be dancing for joy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.98,0:03:15.16,Main,KALAVITH,0,0,0,,Meanie! I really do think of you \Nas a dear friend, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.43,0:03:19.17,Main,KALAVITH,0,0,0,,Look, even you've let me off the hook here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.43,0:03:23.05,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,You have performed much \Nevil as a fallen god,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.05,0:03:26.90,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,but at the same time, \Nyou're my one and only arch-nemesis—
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.79,0:03:29.82,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.82,0:03:31.74,Main,KALAVITH,0,0,0,,See? You do get it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.74,0:03:34.56,Main,KALAVITH,0,0,0,,Well, bye. I'll come again to play with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.01,0:03:52.19,Main,CELINA,0,0,0,,You overslept again?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.53,0:03:55.54,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,Well, I had a bad dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.54,0:03:58.70,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,One that tired me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.07,0:04:00.70,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,By the way, Celina,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.70,0:04:04.54,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,what would you do if you encountered \Narmored bears during a hunt?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.54,0:04:07.66,Main,CELINA,0,0,0,,Huh? Er...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.99,0:04:12.23,Main,CELINA,0,0,0,,I'll use my cursed eyes to send them home.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.23,0:04:15.22,Main,CELINA,0,0,0,,Fighting would be dangerous for both of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.43,0:04:23.98,Main,CELINA,0,0,0,,What? Why are you laughing?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.30,0:04:26.73,Main,MIU,0,0,0,,Welcome!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.86,0:04:30.00,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,Chris, may I ask you something?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.00,0:04:31.90,Main,CHRISTINA,0,0,0,,Sure. What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.90,0:04:35.76,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,I've decided to enroll in \NGaloa's magic academy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.49,0:04:39.14,Main,CHRISTINA,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.14,0:04:42.94,Main,CHRISTINA,0,0,0,,Mind telling me what brought this on?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.70,0:04:46.27,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,I had a dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.87,0:04:50.15,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,A dream about the end of Verun Village.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.15,0:04:51.34,Main,CHRISTINA,0,0,0,,A dream?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.77,0:04:54.42,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,It was weirdly realistic.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.31,0:04:59.84,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,I don't want to lose this village. \NThere are too many people I hold dear here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.25,0:05:05.32,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,And that thought reminded \Nme of what Denzel said.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.68,0:05:08.31,Flashback,DENZEL,0,0,0,,If you want to protect the village you love,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.31,0:05:12.03,Flashback,DENZEL,0,0,0,,leaving it might be one way to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.54,0:05:14.77,Main,CHRISTINA,0,0,0,,Ah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.15,0:05:19.29,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,I want to gain new knowledge \Nat the magic academy
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.29,0:05:22.04,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,and rethink how to take the village forward.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.71,0:05:26.79,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,I think I could help make this \Na better place that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.36,0:05:29.01,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,What do you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.40,0:05:33.13,Main,CHRISTINA,0,0,0,,That sounds great.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.13,0:05:37.31,Main,CHRISTINA,0,0,0,,I would love to have a friend \Nlike you to learn with.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.54,0:05:40.05,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,I appreciate your saying that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.05,0:05:44.70,Main,CHRISTINA,0,0,0,,I'll ask the headmistress about the \Npaperwork for the entrance exam.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.70,0:05:47.03,Main,CHRISTINA,0,0,0,,Let's make a toast.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.15,0:05:50.42,Main,CHRISTINA,0,0,0,,Miu! Another mug of milk, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.42,0:05:53.35,Main,MIU,0,0,0,,Sure! Coming right up!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.35,0:05:57.32,Italics,CELINA,0,0,0,,Dolan's going to leave the village?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.61,0:06:02.70,Main,MAGURU,0,0,0,,You've finally made your decision, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.70,0:06:04.23,Main,ARSENA,0,0,0,,Take care.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.23,0:06:06.22,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,I'm just going to take the exam.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.60,0:06:07.89,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,I'll be right back.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.89,0:06:09.56,Main,CHRISTINA,0,0,0,,Good luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.51,0:06:12.12,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,I'm off.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.78,0:06:29.81,Italics,KALAVITH,0,0,0,,That answer is several generations old.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.81,0:06:32.86,Italics,KALAVITH,0,0,0,,Are you sure about this, Dolly?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.84,0:06:36.86,Italics,DOLAN,0,0,0,,Why are you here, Kalavith?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.10,0:06:40.22,Italics,KALAVITH,0,0,0,,Why am I here? Duh.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.88,0:06:42.32,Italics,KALAVITH,0,0,0,,For love!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.32,0:06:43.63,Italics,KALAVITH,0,0,0,,Just kidding!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.61,0:06:48.13,Italics,DOLAN,0,0,0,,I'm in the middle of an exam here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.81,0:06:51.54,Italics,KALAVITH,0,0,0,,This stuff is a piece of cake for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.54,0:06:53.55,Italics,KALAVITH,0,0,0,,You finished right away and took a nap.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.55,0:06:56.14,Italics,DOLAN,0,0,0,,Wrong. I was meditating.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.14,0:06:57.90,Main,ALISTER,0,0,0,,Examinee Dolan!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.77,0:07:03.14,Main,ALISTER,0,0,0,,Sleeping during the exam? \NYou must be confident.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.14,0:07:07.06,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,Mister Alister, I wasn't sleeping.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.38,0:07:13.40,Main,ALISTER,0,0,0,,If you're done, we can \Nstop wasting time here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.85,0:07:17.85,Main,ALISTER,0,0,0,,You'll have practicals tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.85,0:07:20.53,Main,ALISTER,0,0,0,,Do your best so you have no regrets.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.01,0:07:32.27,Main,ALBERT,0,0,0,,Dolan must be in the middle of his exam now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.27,0:07:35.04,Main,ALBERT,0,0,0,,The magic academy, huh? He's awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.04,0:07:37.00,Main,AIRI,0,0,0,,Unlike someone we know.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.81,0:07:42.17,Main,ALBERT,0,0,0,,Shut it, you shrimp!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.17,0:07:43.18,Main,AIRI,0,0,0,,Wha?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.19,0:07:48.14,Main,BALAN,0,0,0,,Quiet! The monsters will hear us coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.14,0:07:49.63,Main,AIRI,0,0,0,,Sowwy...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.14,0:07:49.63,Main,ALBERT,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.66,0:07:53.13,Main,BALAN,0,0,0,,Up the pace, Celina.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.13,0:07:57.17,Main,CELINA,0,0,0,,Huh? A monster? I'm ready to fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.17,0:07:59.70,Main,CELINA,0,0,0,,Evil snake that binds my soul...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.70,0:08:01.58,Main,CELINA,0,0,0,,Afflict my foes with your curse!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.70,0:08:02.54,Main,BALAN,0,0,0,,Wait, Celina! We haven't run into any yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.58,0:08:03.61,Main,CELINA,0,0,0,,Jalaam!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.70,0:08:13.37,Main,BALAN,0,0,0,,Check if we have any casualties!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.64,0:08:17.81,Main,CELINA,0,0,0,,I'm sorry! I'm so sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.81,0:08:20.24,Main,SOLDIER,0,0,0,,Don't worry. It's just a scratch.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.87,0:08:24.57,Main,ALBERT,0,0,0,,Celina's been down lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.57,0:08:28.64,Main,ALBERT,0,0,0,,Was she that hurt by Dolan's decision \Nto go to the magic academy?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.49,0:08:31.52,Main,ALBERT,0,0,0,,Why doesn't she just go with them, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.81,0:08:32.78,Main,ALBERT,0,0,0,,Ow.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.11,0:08:35.82,Main,AIRI,0,0,0,,You may have forgotten,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.04,0:08:40.08,Main,AIRI,0,0,0,,but lamia are feared as man-eating monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.40,0:08:44.57,Main,AIRI,0,0,0,,You heard about how people on the \Nstreets of Galoa feared her, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.57,0:08:48.58,Main,AIRI,0,0,0,,It'd be impossible to take \Nher to the academy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.58,0:08:51.59,Main,ALBERT,0,0,0,,So, if Dolan enrolls in the magic academy...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.37,0:08:54.81,Main,AIRI,0,0,0,,He won't be back for two years.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.81,0:08:58.98,Main,AIRI,0,0,0,,And he might get a job in town and stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.71,0:09:05.47,Main,ALBERT,0,0,0,,Celina's one thing, \Nbut are you okay with that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.93,0:09:08.61,Main,AIRI,0,0,0,,Lay off!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.76,0:09:36.63,Italics,CELINA,0,0,0,,Because Dolan taught me how to \Nread this country's language,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.03,0:09:41.46,Italics,CELINA,0,0,0,,I can now read picture books \Nlike these by myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.64,0:09:49.94,Italics,CELINA,0,0,0,,He'll probably learn lots at the \Nacademy and become a fine mage.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.94,0:09:53.31,Italics,CELINA,0,0,0,,All to help the village.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.88,0:09:56.91,Italics,CELINA,0,0,0,,He really is amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.53,0:10:01.04,Italics,CELINA,0,0,0,,I want to go with him, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.53,0:10:06.57,Flashback,KIDSMOM,0,0,0,,A lamia?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.57,0:10:08.51,Flashback,KIDSMOM,0,0,0,,Come here! She's dangerous!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.92,0:10:13.67,Italics,CELINA,0,0,0,,I'm a lamia.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.73,0:10:19.24,Italics,CELINA,0,0,0,,I'd only hinder his dream if I went along.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.64,0:10:26.72,Italics,CELINA,0,0,0,,It's fine. I was on a journey \Nto find a husband, anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.18,0:10:36.61,Italics,CELINA,0,0,0,,The lamia tradition where we find a husband
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.61,0:10:38.31,Italics,CELINA,0,0,0,,and have them come to our village...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.02,0:10:41.57,Italics,CELINA,0,0,0,,I need to uphold that first.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.13,0:10:55.44,Main,CELINA,0,0,0,,Dolan!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.71,0:11:05.99,Italics,CELINA,0,0,0,,Oh... So I was in love with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.45,0:11:11.45,Italics,CELINA,0,0,0,,I didn't realize I wanted him to be with me
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.45,0:11:13.94,Italics,CELINA,0,0,0,,and come to the lamia village with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.94,0:11:24.90,Italics,CELINA,0,0,0,,But I also want him to prioritize \Nhis love for Verun Village.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.67,0:11:29.45,Italics,CELINA,0,0,0,,I can't make him ignore this \Nplace because of how I feel.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.38,0:11:37.06,Italics,CELINA,0,0,0,,Life would've been so amazing \Nif I could be with him..
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.81,0:11:54.10,Main,CELINA,0,0,0,,I had so much fun in Verun.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.33,0:12:06.10,Main,DENZEL,0,0,0,,Kept you waiting?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.39,0:12:08.49,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,Denzel.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.96,0:12:11.74,Main,DENZEL,0,0,0,,I heard you finished the \Nwritten exam in no time.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.74,0:12:14.38,Main,DENZEL,0,0,0,,I'm looking forward to seeing \Nyou here as a student.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.38,0:12:17.50,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,Hey, we don't know that I passed yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.30,0:12:22.44,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,By the way, Denzel, \Nthere's something I want to ask you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.34,0:12:37.27,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,Celina, do you have a moment?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.68,0:12:40.64,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,I have some news for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.09,0:12:48.47,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,Celina?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.05,0:13:02.61,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,"To the Villagers." "To Dolan"?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.47,0:13:08.94,Italics,CELINA,0,0,0,,Hello, Dolan.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.94,0:13:13.31,Italics,CELINA,0,0,0,,Uh, is this how you're \Nsupposed to start a letter?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.20,0:13:16.34,Italics,CELINA,0,0,0,,How was the exam?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.34,0:13:23.35,Italics,CELINA,0,0,0,,I'm sure you would say, \N"Hmph. Not a problem," like you usually do.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.94,0:13:28.51,Italics,CELINA,0,0,0,,Er, I apologize for leaving \Nthe village so suddenly.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.86,0:13:34.25,Italics,CELINA,0,0,0,,Seeing you take a step forward \Ngot me all motivated as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.62,0:13:40.87,Italics,CELINA,0,0,0,,I've decided to restart \Nmy search for a husband.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.20,0:13:54.39,Italics,CELINA,0,0,0,,I didn't have the heart \Nto say goodbye in person,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.39,0:13:55.92,Italics,CELINA,0,0,0,,so I'm leaving this letter.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.30,0:14:00.98,Italics,CELINA,0,0,0,,Thank you for everything, Dolan.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.98,0:14:06.98,Italics,CELINA,0,0,0,,I'm really glad I got to meet \Nyou and live in Verun Village.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.43,0:14:09.36,Italics,CELINA,0,0,0,,To my beloved Dolan.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.89,0:14:11.20,Italics,CELINA,0,0,0,,From Celina.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.93,0:14:14.32,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,Celina!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.75,0:14:52.05,Italics,CELINA,0,0,0,,What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.05,0:14:53.67,Italics,CELINA,0,0,0,,I've never seen anything like it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.92,0:14:55.40,Italics,CELINA,0,0,0,,A demon?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.76,0:14:58.41,Italics,CELINA,0,0,0,,But we closed the portal.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.02,0:15:02.17,Italics,CELINA,0,0,0,,Is that a dragon, \Nlike the ones Dolan mentioned?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.50,0:15:03.31,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,Celina!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.57,0:15:19.24,Italics,CELINA,0,0,0,,Dolan's here! This is so awkward!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.76,0:15:27.28,Main,CELINA,0,0,0,,Is this...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.73,0:15:32.47,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,Oh, this takes me back.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.20,0:15:36.65,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,This is where we first met.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.65,0:15:40.53,Main,CELINA,0,0,0,,Yeah, I still remember it \Nlike it was yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.78,0:15:44.78,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,Your seduction dance was so cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.78,0:15:48.05,Main,CELINA,0,0,0,,Grr! That's insulting!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.05,0:15:50.59,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,Look, Celina!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.36,0:15:58.06,Main,CELINA,0,0,0,,Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.53,0:16:00.79,Main,CELINA,0,0,0,,Are those earth elementals?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.83,0:16:05.95,Main,CELINA,0,0,0,,The lizards aren't back yet, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.52,0:16:11.50,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,Even though the area is calm now, \Nmoving back here can't be easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.27,0:16:17.49,Main,CELINA,0,0,0,,We only first met recently, \Nbut it feels like forever ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.14,0:16:19.56,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,Same here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.67,0:16:25.30,Italics,CELINA,0,0,0,,I made so many memories, \Nall because of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.30,0:16:26.96,Italics,CELINA,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.35,0:16:34.31,Italics,CELINA,0,0,0,,Dolan, I'm so glad I came to Verun.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.03,0:16:41.35,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,Sorry for suddenly deciding \Nto join the academy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.64,0:16:46.60,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,I should've talked to you about it first.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.73,0:16:53.12,Main,CELINA,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, too. I tried to leave the \Nvillage without telling anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.14,0:16:56.36,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,When I was there for the exam, I asked...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.15,0:17:00.31,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,And I found out that students \Nmay bring familiars with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.52,0:17:04.28,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,You need to form a pact, \Nbut once that's done,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.28,0:17:07.83,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,they can even bring monsters to the academy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.56,0:17:12.51,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,If you wouldn't mind, \Nwould you please come with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.55,0:17:17.13,Italics,CELINA,0,0,0,,I can... go?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.70,0:17:20.06,Italics,CELINA,0,0,0,,I can go with Dolan?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.76,0:17:27.07,Main,CELINA,0,0,0,,You don't get it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.07,0:17:29.23,Main,CELINA,0,0,0,,Lamia are man-eating monsters!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.83,0:17:33.19,Main,CELINA,0,0,0,,Do you know what people will think of you
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.19,0:17:36.15,Main,CELINA,0,0,0,,if you walk around with a monster in tow?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.67,0:17:39.36,Main,CELINA,0,0,0,,What about the teachers and \Nother students at the academy?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.61,0:17:43.35,Main,CELINA,0,0,0,,They won't think kindly of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.00,0:17:46.26,Main,CELINA,0,0,0,,You'll never make any friends!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.26,0:17:49.03,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,If anyone badmouths you, \NI'll deal with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.03,0:17:50.99,Main,CELINA,0,0,0,,That's even worse!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.74,0:17:57.14,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,Are you okay?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.52,0:18:02.99,Main,CELINA,0,0,0,,You're going to become a fine mage, \Ngain power and influence,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.99,0:18:04.99,Main,CELINA,0,0,0,,and help the village, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.72,0:18:07.87,Main,CELINA,0,0,0,,Then you mustn't cause any problems.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.50,0:18:11.14,Main,CELINA,0,0,0,,You can't take me along.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.81,0:18:16.40,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,If anything happens in town, \Nwe can work on it together.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.69,0:18:19.40,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,And I don't mind if I don't make \Nany friends in the academy!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.60,0:18:25.66,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,I want to see a new world with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.91,0:18:37.15,Main,CELINA,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.04,0:18:44.40,Main,CELINA,0,0,0,,Me, too... I wadda go with you, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.96,0:19:02.06,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,Mm. I passed.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.06,0:19:03.56,Main,VILLAGERS,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.12,0:19:06.74,Main,DENZEL,0,0,0,,Congratulations.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.99,0:19:11.26,Main,MAGURU,0,0,0,,In the name of the \NGod of Contracts La Warter,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.26,0:19:16.13,Main,MAGURU,0,0,0,,I hereby pronounce a true and binding \Npact formed between you two.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.22,0:19:23.25,Main,MAGURU,0,0,0,,That symbolizes that you have \Nformed a familiar pact.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.51,0:19:29.60,Main,CELINA,0,0,0,,Wow... So this is the symbol of our bond.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.44,0:19:40.00,Main,CHIEF,0,0,0,,Christina.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.48,0:19:43.61,Main,CHIEF,0,0,0,,We leave Dolan and Celina in your hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.99,0:19:45.12,Main,CHRISTINA,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.41,0:19:48.00,Main,ARSENA,0,0,0,,Don't follow any strangers.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.00,0:19:49.20,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,I'll keep it in mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.75,0:19:52.12,Main,MARCO,0,0,0,,I'll take care of your home, brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.12,0:19:54.63,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,Good luck living alone, Marco.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.63,0:19:55.97,Main,AIRI,0,0,0,,Celina.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.97,0:19:57.12,Main,CELINA,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.51,0:20:01.76,Main,AIRI,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.39,0:20:07.96,Main,AIRI,0,0,0,,I'll be joining the magic \Nacademy next year, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.34,0:20:11.69,Main,AIRI,0,0,0,,Take care of Dolan until then.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.02,0:20:14.90,Main,CELINA,0,0,0,,Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.26,0:20:19.29,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,We should go. \NWe can't be here chatting all day.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.29,0:20:22.27,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,Thank you all for coming to see us off.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.27,0:20:23.26,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,Giddy-up!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.27,0:20:33.16,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,If anything happens, I'll come rushing \Nback from the academy, I promise!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.99,0:20:37.14,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,Don't get sick! Don't get hurt!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.14,0:20:40.17,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,Please be well until I return!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.12,0:20:43.52,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,See you later!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.10,0:21:00.53,Main,CHRISTINA,0,0,0,,Once we reach Galoa, you'll be \Nbusy with the enrolling procedures.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.53,0:21:02.66,Main,CHRISTINA,0,0,0,,You won't have time to feel sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.66,0:21:03.82,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.38,0:21:06.83,Main,CELINA,0,0,0,,Are the students there nice?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.83,0:21:09.33,Main,CELINA,0,0,0,,Will we have to deal with \Nany scary seniors?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.57,0:21:14.53,Main,CHRISTINA,0,0,0,,Don't worry. If anyone dares bully \Nyou two, I'll deal with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.55,0:21:21.06,Italics,CELINA,0,0,0,,Dolan's and my new life is about to begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.15,0:21:27.59,Italics,CELINA,0,0,0,,I'll always be with him. \NIt feels like a dream come true.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.21,0:21:31.07,Italics,CELINA,0,0,0,,Now we can be lovers and...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.54,0:21:36.68,Italics,CELINA,0,0,0,,Lovers?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.98,0:21:39.91,Italics,CELINA,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.16,0:21:46.58,Flashback,DOLAN,0,0,0,,I want to see a new world with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.27,0:21:49.56,Italics,CELINA,0,0,0,,Was that...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.68,0:21:52.98,Italics,CELINA,0,0,0,,not a declaration of love?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.04,0:22:00.74,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah. I'd like to visit your \Nvillage sometime too, Celina.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.08,0:22:01.91,Main,CELINA,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.63,0:22:07.13,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,If you could stay with me and not get sick \Nof me until then, I'd appreciate it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.71,0:22:11.17,Main,CELINA,0,0,0,,Of course!
